- `CAT_VIET_360_4K_Low` → a `264_1080_6Mbps_96_High5.1` file (1,816,249,534 B) under a 4K name.
  Genuine 3840×2160 Vietnam 360 **does** exist, but only as representation id 3 (bw 19,995,653) inside
